'''Longnecks''' (ロングネック, ''Rongu Nekku'', '''Long Neck''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Worker Cat Start Level UP (M): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +2.

